\":\\\"mt-4 font-sans text-sm leading-relaxed text-sol-bark/70\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Pacengo di Lazise, a pochi passi dal Lago di Garda, è il posto dove la nostra famiglia ha scelto di mettere radici. E ogni anno, da questa terra, nascono i prodotti, le esperienze e l'accoglienza che rendono ogni soggiorno diverso dagli altri.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"mt-4 font-sans text-sm leading-relaxed text-sol-bark/70\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Accogliamo ogni ospite con la stessa cura con cui si accoglie qualcuno a casa propria. Perche in fondo, questo posto è casa - e quando ci si sente a casa, si torna sempre.\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"relative bg-sol-sand p-10 md:p-14\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"pointer-events-none absolute top-4 left-6 font-serif text-8xl leading-none text-sol-terracotta/20\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"“\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"blockquote\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"relative z-10 font-serif text-xl leading-relaxed italic text-sol-bark/80\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Abbiamo scelto di aprire le porte di casa nostra perché crediamo che la vera ospitalità non si insegna - si sente.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"mt-6 font-sans text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-sol-bark/40\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"- La nostra famiglia\\\"}]]}]]}]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"section\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"bg-sol-sand py-24 md:py-32\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 md:px-16\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"header\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"mx-auto mb-16 max-w-2xl text-center\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"span\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-sans text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-sol-olive\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Quello in cui crediamo\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"mt-4 font-serif text-4xl font-light text-sol-bark md:text-5xl\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"I valori che guidano ogni scelta\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"grid grid-cols-1 gap-8 md:grid-cols-2\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"article\\\",\\\"01\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"bg-sol-cream p-8\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-serif text-5xl font-light text-sol-terracotta/30\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"01\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h3\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"mt-2 font-serif text-xl text-sol-bark\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Autenticita\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"mt-3 font-sans text-sm leading-relaxed text-sol-bark/70\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Niente qui è costruito per sembrare quello che non è. I prodotti vengono dalla nostra terra, le ricette dalla nostra tradizione, l'accoglienza dal nostro carattere.\\\"}]]}],\\\"$L18\\\",\\\"$L19\\\",\\\"$L1a\\\"]}]]}]}],\\\"$L1b\\\",\\\"$L1c\\\",\\\"$L1d\\\"],null,\\\"$L1e\\\"]}]\\n\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1f:[]\\n13:\\\"$W1f\\\"\\n14:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$1\\\",\\\"h\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[null,[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L20\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":\\\"$L21\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"hidden\\\":true,\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L22\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$23\\\",null,{\\\"name\\\":\\\"Next.Metadata\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"$L24\\\"}]}]}],null]}]\\n16:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"link\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"rel\\\":\\\"stylesheet\\\",\\\"href\\\":\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0bh8m..b~jckt.css\\\",\\\"precedence\\\":\\\"next\\\",\\\"crossOrigin\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"nonce\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\"}]\\n\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"25:I[97367,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0scs0g9f1_sv4.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0eewamb49pw7k.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0ps5_aybo7288.js\\\"],\\\"OutletBoundary\\\"]\\n18:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"article\\\",\\\"02\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"bg-sol-cream p-8\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-serif text-5xl font-ligh